  "notes": [
    "Ciel/open_pdks f6eeac7dad085ffcc829ccfd721f7b4ce39edcf7, 5-metal gf180mcuD (Metal5 81/0 is the top metal; MetalTop 53/0 and Via5 are 6LM only and not mapped).",
    "GF180 has no separate pin datatype: PIN shapes go to drawing XX/0 and to XX/10, labels to XX/10. PR boundary is PR_bndry 0/0.",
    "LEF/DEF use 2000 DBU/um; the GDS database unit must be 0.001 um, so export-gds divides coordinates by 2 exactly and rejects odd coordinates."
  ]
